        <mxCell id="m2_hdr" value="&lt;b&gt;MODUL 2: TERMINAL TRANSAKSI KASIR (POS), VALIDASI STOK &amp; TRANSAKSI DATABASE ACID&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;color:#94A3B8;&quot;&gt;TransaksiPanel.java, TransaksiService.java, TransaksiDao.java, BarangDao.java, AntrianDao.java&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#1E293B;fontColor=#F8FAFC;fontSize=15;align=center;arcSize=8;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="550" y="25" width="900" height="65" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m2_from_auth" value="[FROM MODUL 1: NAVIGASI POS]" style="shape=offPageConnector;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#059669;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;align=center;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="910" y="115" width="200" height="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m2_prep" value="PREPARATION (State Transaksi Kasir POS &amp; Keranjang):
[IPO Context]:
• Input: txtCariKatalog, QtyStepper (+/-), txtBayar, QuickCash Buttons, txtPelanggan, chkBuatAntrian
• Process: Subtotal = Σ(Harga * Qty), Total = Subtotal - Diskon, Validasi Stok Fisik DB, ACID Commit
• Output: Struk Transaksi, Potong Stok Barang di DB, Generate Tiket Antrian Cetak
[Deklarasi Variabel]:
• List&lt;TransaksiItem&gt; keranjang = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;()
• List&lt;Katalog&gt; katalogData = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;()
• BigDecimal subtotal = ZERO, total = ZERO, bayar = ZERO, kembali = ZERO
• boolean modeBarang = true, buatAntrian = true; String kodeNota = &#x27;&#x27;" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fixedSize=1;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;fontColor=#78350F;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="790" y="200" width="440" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m2_sub_katalog" value="Subroutine: reloadKatalog()
Ambil katalog barang &amp; jasa aktif dari DB" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#E0E7FF;strokeColor=#6366F1;fontColor=#312E81;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
